# Warm-up, run first by performance.sh and perfci.sh in every benchdnn
# process, for both flavors (see warmup.matmul). The analysis drops every
# problem named warmup:*.
--dir=FWD_B --alg=direct --mb=1
--wtag=any --attr-post-ops=
--stag=axb --dtag=axb
ic64ih14oc64oh14kh1ph0n"warmup:1x1"
ic32ih28oc32oh28kh3ph1n"warmup:3x3"
--stag=abx --dtag=abx
ic32ih28oc32oh28kh3ph1n"warmup:ncsp"
